  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DELF-Conflict transformation inthe Palestinian areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Palestinian people is deeply marked by the long lasting and unsolved conflict with Israel. The conflict also affects and contaminates the daily life of the people. With main focus on children and youth the project promote transforming and resolving conflicts through valuing differences among the people. The valuing of differences are used to see conflict as a way to grow.</narrative>
  </description>
